5. Ransomware Early Detection & Automatic Response System
Problem Statement
Design a system that detects ransomware-like behavior at an early stage and automatically isolates the affected device before the attack spreads.
Functional Requirements
•	Monitor endpoint activity 
•	Detect abnormal file operations 
•	Detect suspicious encryption behavior 
•	Generate alerts 
•	Calculate risk score 
•	Isolate compromised devices 
•	Notify security analysts 
•	Maintain incident logs 
Non-Functional Requirements
•	Real-time detection 
•	High availability 
•	Low detection latency 
•	Scalability 
•	Reliable logging 
 

